+<h2 id="what-is-not-included">What is not included</h2>
+<ul>
+<li><strong>Wireless (Wi-Fi):</strong> not included. There are no Wi-Fi drivers or firmware on the installer, and wireless cards are blocked from loading. Use a separate access point.</li>
+<li><strong>ARM builds and Secure Boot signing:</strong> not built yet.</li>
+</ul>
 <h2 id="ports-gatehouse-uses">Ports Gatehouse uses</h2>
 <ul>
 <li><strong>443</strong>: the console (HTTPS). You can change it under <strong>Settings, General, Console address</strong>.</li>
